  "id": "blm",
  "term": "BLM",
  "definition": "BLM refers to a narrow bottom-line focus, especially in leaders, in which emphasis is placed strongly on performance results and the bottom line. In workplace research, it is studied in relation to employees’ behavior, relationships, performance responses, innovation, and their sense of meaning and social value at work.",
